12. LED circuit diagram (schematic style)
A simple schematic: Arduino Pin 9 → 220 Ω resistor → LED anode → LED cathode → GND. Each component labeled with its value. Current direction shown with an arrow. The voltage drops labeled: 3V across resistor, 2V across LED.
